      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo is delighted to present this spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in Kildare Town. Extending to approximately 107.2 sq. m., the property is presented in turnkey condition and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises an entrance hallway, guest WC, comfortable living room with wood-burning stove, and a generous open-plan kitchen/dining area with adjoining utility room and direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes, including a spacious main bedroom with en-suite shower room, along with a family bathroom and hot press. The property has been carefully maintained and upgraded, with attractive flooring, contemporary LED lighting and excellent storage throughout. A B-rated BER provides good energy efficiency and may also allow purchasers to avail of lower-rate green mortgage products, subject to lender criteria.\r\n\r\nOutside is a particular highlight of the property. To the front, a large tarmac driveway provides off-street parking for up to four cars, while a private gated side entrance leads to the fully enclosed rear garden. The garden includes a lawn, raised planting area, large composite storage shed and an impressive covered decking and pergola area, creating an excellent additional space for dining, entertaining, exercise or everyday use throughout much of the year.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nThis property is located just a few minutes walk to Kildare Town train station and is close to the M7 motorway, providing excellent commuting options.\r\n\r\nKildare Town is serviced by 3 main supermarkets, Tesco, Aldi and Lidl as well as a good selection of pubs, restaurants, cafes and eateries. Kildare Village outlet centre is located just next to the N7 at junction 13.\r\n\r\nThe famous Curragh Racecourse is nearby in addition to The Curragh itself, offering plenty of outdoor space for dog walks, cycling etc.\r\n\r\nThe main schools located nearby are St. Brigid's Primary School and Scoil Na Mainistreach De La Salle.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
